					<td id="NewsCell" width="100%"><font size = 4><b>Aary downed</font></b> <br><font size = 2><i>Rydius               - 10/6/2002 7:35:11 PM</i></font><br><br><P>Die.</P>
<P><IMG style=WIDTH: 786px; HEIGHT: 603px height=584 src=/oryx/images/Aary.jpg width=774></P>
<P>And then since it was like, 2-3am we got feshlak and DTD.&nbsp; Lady Nev, you die soon.</P><br><hr align = left width = 10%><font size = 4><b>Weekend of 22nd</font></b> <br><font size = 2><i>Rydius               - 9/25/2002 11:23:11 PM</i></font><br><br><P>Rawr, back into NToV... we had 2 flawless kills but took us second attempts to nab...</P>
<P><IMG src=/oryx/images/Feshlak.jpg></P>
<P>and also Kriezenn. no SS, sorry&nbsp; =/</P>
<P>Grats Moosh on the boots, and Gotty on the sword :) and I forget what Kreizenn dropped... but grats!!&nbsp; Too much loot too fast.</P>
<P>Koi surprised us, heh that siren song is nasty in the hands of a mob tripling for 750s at a 24 delay...60% haste plz.&nbsp; Caught us unprepared in terms of cheal timing, but we went back and got him after that.</P>
<P>&nbsp;</P>
<P>Rawr Clef gets a siren song!! (go bards) and Bannefin gets a Trident. </P>
<P><IMG src=/oryx/images/lordkoi.jpg></P>
<P>We aslo dropped Jorleag, Eashen of the Sky, Ikitiar, Sevelak (again), and Lady Mirenella.&nbsp; Mith boots = tasty.</P>
<P>The mistell of the day award goes to... &gt;:) Solanthious!!</P>
<P><IMG src=http://www.oryxguild.com/oryx/images/solmistell.bmp></P>
<P>Close runner up though, thx chenz.</P>
<P><IMG src=http://www.oryxguild.com/oryx/images/chenzmistell.bmp></P>
<P>And here's Jarhn, showing us how he uses his BP for protection.</P>
<P><IMG src=/oryx/images/jarhnBP.jpg></P>
<P>Jarhn.... no.&nbsp; God, no. Didn't you pay attention in Sex Ed?</P>
<P>Good work guys :) more to come.</P><br><hr align = left width = 10%><font size = 4><b>Welcome Oryx to NToV</font></b> <br><font size = 2><i>Dhido                - 9/16/2002 6:25:03 PM</i></font><br><br><P>It was a night just like any other. The Oryx folks wanted to see everything and anything dead - not because they had to, but because it's just so damn much fun.&nbsp;After slaying the foul beast Dozekar (Congrats Ferok, Clef, Rezzen, and Zupa on tears!), we decided to venture into new territory - the North halls of the Temple of Veeshan.</P>
<P>The raid went amazingly well, and while the main purpose was to explore, and test the waters - so to speak - we got the wonderful opportunity to kill a REAL DRAGON! Sevalak died by our hands,&nbsp;congratulations to Sosk, whose piercing is now maxed, on a brand new 2 hand piercer, as well as Haladrim on a nice new shield! </P>
<P>Expect to see many more updates like this in the near future. Congratulations, Oryx. We're here!</P>
<P>Now some screenshots! </P>
<P>Big, dead dragon in NToV!</P>
<P><IMG src=/oryx/images/ntov.jpg></P>
<P>And guess who got the killshot? That's right! The ranger!</P>
<P><IMG src=/oryx/images/rangerkill.jpg></P>
<P>I don't quite know how to introduce this screenshot, pretty much speaks for itself.</P>
<P><IMG src=/oryx/images/aaidinquote.jpg></P>
<P>In keeping with the ogre theme....</P>
<P><IMG src=/oryx/images/ogre.jpg></P>
<P>That's all for now kids, all hail the goat!</P>
